The application cannot be called final merely because the APK builds.

It must pass the following tests.

| Test                                   | Required result               |
| -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Skip pipeline stages                   | Rejected                      |
| Unauthorized stage transition          | Rejected                      |
| AI-generated approval                  | Rejected                      |
