A release must be reproducible from its signed manifest and registered source assets.

## 15. Constitutional laws — permanent and non-negotiable

The recovered C18 Creative Constitution is particularly important. It establishes sovereign human authorship and layer monotonicity: higher layers may analyze lower-layer evidence, but cannot rewrite foundational evidence or historical ledgers.&#x20;

